{'symbol': 'NDSN', 'date': '2022-11-30 00:17:00', 'title': 'NORDSON ELECTRONICS SOLUTIONS INTRODUCES NEW SELECT SYNCHRO SELECTIVE SOLDERING SYSTEM TO INCREASE THROUGHPUT AND FLEXIBILITY WHILE REDUCING FOOTPRINT AND COST-OF-OWNERSHIP', 'text': 'CARLSBAD, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--NORDSON ELECTRONICS SOLUTIONS, A GLOBAL LEADER IN ELECTRONICS MANUFACTURING TECHNOLOGIES, INTRODUCES THE NEW SELECT SYNCHRO™ SELECTIVE SOLDERING SYSTEM FOR HIGH-VOLUME PRINTED CIRCUIT BOARD ASSEMBLY APPLICATIONS. THE SELECT SYNCHRO IS A MULTI-STATION SELECTIVE SOLDERING SYSTEM (PATENT PENDING) THAT USES A UNIQUE, SYNCHRONOUS MOTION TO INCREASE THROUGHPUT, IMPROVE COST-OF-OWNERSHIP, AND PROVIDE FLEXIBILITY FOR ELECTRONICS MANUFACTURERS.'}